OL,3,GNEWSA'Great sadness' as fire damage
OL,4,Aforces golf club to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FA golf club has been forced to close
OL,7,Fafter a fire caused "significant
OL,8,Fdamage" to its clubhouse on Saturday
OL,9,Fevening.
OL,11,FNorth Wales Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,Fsaid firefighters were called to a
OL,13,Fbuilding fire at Conwy Golf Club at
OL,14,Fabout 21:21 GMT.
OL,16,FCrews from several fire stations
OL,17,Fattended the scene and remained on site
OL,18,Fon Sunday, but the cause of the blaze
OL,19,Fhas not yet been determined.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
