OL,3,GNEWSA'Great sadness' as fire damage
OL,4,Aforces golf club to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement on social media, Conwy
OL,7,FGolf Club said: "It is with great
OL,8,Fsadness that we must share that a
OL,9,Fserious fire occurred at the clubhouse
OL,10,Flast night."
